---
const beats = [
  {
    n: '01',
    title: 'El link funciona a cualquier hora',
    body: 'Fuera de horario, feriados o mientras estás con otro cliente, el turnero sigue tomando reservas.'
  },
  {
    n: '02',
    title: 'Confirmación al instante',
    body: 'El cliente ve la disponibilidad real de tu agenda y recibe los detalles por email apenas reserva.'
  },
  {
    n: '03',
    title: 'Nadie se queda sin turno',
    body: 'Sin ida y vuelta de mensajes ni llamados perdidos: el horario se bloquea en el momento.'
  }
];

const days = [
  { label: 'JUE 3', variant: 'a' },
  { label: 'VIE 4', variant: 'b' },
  { label: 'LUN 7', variant: '' },
  { label: 'MIE 8', variant: '' },
  { label: 'JUE 9', variant: '' }
];
---

<section
  class="landing-section bg-bg-primary"
  id="turnero-publico"
  data-public-turnero
>
  <div class="landing-container">
    <div class="grid gap-12 lg:grid-cols-2 lg:items-center lg:gap-16">
      <div class="reveal">
        <div class="mb-5 flex items-center gap-2">
          <span class="h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-primary" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          <p class="text-sm text-text-secondary font-body">Turnero público — disponible ahora</p>
        </div>

        <h2 class="landing-title font-headline font-bold text-text-primary mb-5">
          Tus clientes reservan desde el celular, sin llamarte
        </h2>

        <p class="text-text-secondary font-body leading-relaxed mb-8 max-w-xl">
          Compartís el link una vez. Tu cliente elige servicio, profesional y horario con disponibilidad real, y el turno queda confirmado al instante — sin instalar nada, sin cuenta, sin que atiendas el teléfono.
        </p>

        <ol class="mb-8" data-public-turnero-chips>
          {beats.map((beat) => (
            <li class="border-t border-border py-5">
              <div class="flex gap-4">
                <span class="mt-0.5 shrink-0 font-headline text-sm text-primary/55">{beat.n}</span>
                <div>
                  <p class="font-headline font-semibold text-text-primary">{beat.title}</p>
                  <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-text-secondary">{beat.body}</p>
                </div>
              </div>
            </li>
          ))}
        </ol>

        <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-4 gap-y-2">
          <a href="/auth/signup/plan" class="btn btn-primary py-4 px-10 text-sm">
            Empezá gratis
          </a>
          <p class="text-sm text-text-secondary">No necesitás tarjeta para probarlo</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div>
        <div class="relative min-h-[540px] w-full" data-public-turnero-shots>
          <div
            class="pointer-events-none absolute left-1/2 top-16 h-72 w-72 -translate-x-1/2 rounded-full bg-primary/25 blur-3xl"
            aria-hidden="true"
          ></div>

          <div
            class="landing-card absolute top-14 right-0 w-[78%] rotate-6 p-5 opacity-70 shadow-xl"
            aria-hidden="true"
          >
            <div class="space-y-3">
              <div class="h-3 w-24 rounded-full bg-white/10"></div>
              <div class="h-8 w-full rounded-xl bg-white/5"></div>
              <div class="h-8 w-5/6 rounded-xl bg-white/5"></div>
              <div class="h-16 w-full rounded-2xl bg-white/5"></div>
              <div class="h-10 w-full rounded-xl bg-primary/20"></div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <article
            class="relative z-10 w-[92%] max-w-[420px] rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-bg-secondary p-5 text-text-primary shadow-2xl"
          >
            <p class="text-[11px] font-medium tracking-wide text-text-secondary">Portal de reservas online</p>
            <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-text-secondary">Bienvenido a</p>
            <p class="font-headline font-bold text-lg text-primary">barber shop</p>
            <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-text-secondary">Reservá tu próximo turno en segundos.</p>

            <div class="mt-5 space-y-4">
              <div>
                <p class="text-[11px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-text-secondary">
                  1 · Elegí el servicio
                </p>
                <div class="mt-2 flex items-center justify-between rounded-xl bg-primary px-3 py-2.5 text-text-on-secondary">
                  <p class="text-sm font-headline font-semibold">Afeitado clásico · 30 min</p>
                  <p class="text-sm font-bold">$1000</p>
                </div>
              </div>

              <div>
                <p class="text-[11px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-text-secondary">
                  2 · Elegí profesional
                </p>
                <div class="mt-2 rounded-xl border border-white/10 bg-white/5 px-3 py-2.5">
                  <p class="text-sm font-headline font-semibold">Cualquier profesional</p>
                  <p class="text-[11px] text-text-secondary">Más horarios disponibles</p>
                </div>
                <div class="mt-2 flex items-center gap-3 rounded-xl border border-white/10 px-3 py-2.5">
                  <span
                    class="flex h-8 w-8 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-primary/15 text-[11px] font-headline font-bold text-primary"
                  >
                    JM
                  </span>
                  <div>
                    <p class="text-sm font-headline font-semibold">Javier Mansilla</p>
                    <p class="text-[11px] text-text-secondary">Próximo lugar: Jue 3 · 09:00</p>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>

              <div>
                <p class="text-[11px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-text-secondary">
                  3 · Elegí día y horario
                </p>
                <div class="mt-2 flex flex-wrap gap-2">
                  {days.map((day) => (
                    <span
                      class:list={[
                        'public-turnero-day rounded-full px-3 py-1.5 text-[11px] font-headline font-semibold',
                        day.variant === 'a' && 'public-turnero-day--a',
                        day.variant === 'b' && 'public-turnero-day--b',
                        !day.variant && 'bg-white/5 text-text-secondary'
                      ]}
                    >
                      {day.label}
                    </span>
                  ))}
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </article>
        </div>
        <p class="mt-4 text-[11px] text-text-secondary">
          Así se ve el link público de reservas.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .public-turnero-day--a {
    background: #7c3aed;
    color: #fff;
  }

  .public-turnero-day--b {
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
    color: #94a3b8;
  }

  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: no-preference) {
    .public-turnero-day--a {
      animation: public-turnero-day-a 4.8s ease-in-out infinite;
    }

    .public-turnero-day--b {
      animation: public-turnero-day-b 4.8s ease-in-out infinite;
    }
  }

  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .public-turnero-day--a,
    .public-turnero-day--b {
      animation: none;
    }
  }

  @keyframes public-turnero-day-a {
    0%,
    45% {
      background: #7c3aed;
      color: #fff;
    }
    55%,
    100% {
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
      color: #94a3b8;
    }
  }

  @keyframes public-turnero-day-b {
    0%,
    45% {
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
      color: #94a3b8;
    }
    55%,
    100% {
      background: #7c3aed;
      color: #fff;
    }
  }
</style>
